    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster",
        "text": "We meet again... Umiri."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster",
        "text": "Heh, and here I was wondering why a pro like you never got taken in by any famiglie."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster",
        "text": "See, after ours fell on hard times, I asked around, and that's how I learned you made your career out of being a traitor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster",
        "text": "You've gone through a dozen names bouncing around every famiglia out there."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "Our contracts never said we couldn't do work for others."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "And like I said long ago: I only take my reward and fulfill the duties that match it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 12,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster",
        "text": "Is that why you sold our secrets to our enemies?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "...I don't know what you're talking about."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster",
        "text": "Don't play dumb, you goddamn traitor! Ever since you showed up, our people have been getting screwed left and right!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lead Mobster",
        "text": "All thanks to me and the don being stupid enough to trust you. We even invited you to join us!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "Francis, I don't remember what I've done to offend you all\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Francis",
        "text": "Hmph. What, you owe so many people you can't even remember?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Francis",
        "text": "The don's dead, everyone's dead! We had hundreds of people, and now it's just our dozen left!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "...What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Francis",
        "text": "We busted our asses moving from Columbia to this stupid place, but you had to go and get everyone killed!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angry Mobster",
        "text": "No more talk. There's enough of us here to teach her a very painful lesson today!"
