    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice",
        "text": "The guys in the prison didn't give you any trouble, did they?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#11$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "They're all old friends. Besides, they know who my employer is. They wouldn't want to stick their hands in the fire."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "But I imagine you didn't summon me just to ask that, did you, sir?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice",
        "text": "Kheheh. Just concerned for a business partner, that's all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "Sir, when did we become partners?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "When you signed your contract with me, you wouldn't even use your famiglia's name."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice",
        "text": "Well, if you want to become 'partners', and I know you do, then let me lay my cards out\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice",
        "text": "Umiri, I'd like to have you for a long-term job."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "What kind of job requires us to meet face-to-face?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice",
        "text": "I'm thinking... of inviting you into the famiglia."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#6$3",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata",
        "text": "What... did you say?"
    },
